00:24:29.367 --> 00:24:30.969
is food security.

00:24:30.969 --> 00:24:32.771
And for my audience,

00:24:32.771 --> 00:24:34.906
obviously doesn't watch
much mainstream media,

00:24:34.906 --> 00:24:37.042
but they are paying attention
